{"id":"00152","root":"uni00152_1","name":{"ja":"眞田　焔","en":"Sanada Homura"},"title":{"ja":"【稽古初め】","en":"【First Lesson】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【稽古初め】 眞田　焔","en":"【First Lesson】 Sanada Homura"},"element":"Natural","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2018-12-31","limited":true,"characterId":49,"profile":{"ja":"対魔忍として、長らく任務に就いていた女性。長らく実戦に身を置き、その実力は折り紙つき。あまたの魔族との戦闘をこなしてきたため、魔族との戦闘にかけてはかなりの腕。非常に血の気が多く、闘う事しか考えていない。対魔忍とは名ばかりの戦闘狂。そのため、長期の任務に就くことが多かったが、ひとたび里に戻ると、教師だろうが生徒だろうがお構い無しに特訓と称してぼこっているため、一部からは恐れられている。実際は実力を認めている相手にしかしないため、それを知っている者は止める事はしない。戦闘スタイルは、長槍に火遁を織り交ぜたスタイル。槍の柄を爆発させ、まるでロケットのように突っ込み、触れる者を焼き払い、惨殺する豪快な戦闘をする。陽動兼超火力を振り回す間に、他の対魔忍が要人を暗殺するなどの通常任務をこなす事が多い。本人はめんどくさい作戦など無く好き勝手に暴れる事ができて満足している。新年だからと晴れ着を着ているが、焔自身の中身は当然なんの変化もない。それどころか正月気分で浮かれる者達を「初稽古だ！」と燃える焔は、恐怖のどん底にたたき落としていく。","en":"(Sanada Homura, she/her) As a Taimanin, she has long been on active duty. Years of frontline combat have cemented her reputation, and having fought countless demons, she is exceptionally skilled against them. She is hot-blooded and thinks of nothing but battle—a true combat fanatic who wears the title of Taimanin like a badge. Consequently, she often takes on long-term missions, but whenever she returns to a village she trains everyone—teachers, students, anyone—under the guise of \"special training,\" which has earned her a fearsome reputation among some. In truth, she only pushes those who have earned her respect, and those who know this rarely try to stop her. Her fighting style blends a long spear with fire techniques: she detonates the spear's shaft, thrusting it like a rocket, scorching and brutally slaying anything it touches. While she creates a diversion with overwhelming firepower, other Taimanin carry out usual tasks such as assassinating high-value targets. She has no patience for tedious plans and is content to wreak havoc on her own terms. Though she dons festive clothing for the New Year, Homura's inner flame remains unchanged. In fact, she scoffs at those who get giddy about the holiday, shouting \"First training!\" and hurling them into the depths of terror."},"illustrator":"のぶしと","voiceActor":"疾風はる","forms":[{"id":"uni00152_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[928,1856],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[145,275],"def":[118,235],"spd":[72,72],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["4","80007"]},{"id":"uni00152_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1356,2712],"sp":[230,230],"atk":[225,450],"def":[171,340],"spd":[72,72],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["4","80007","80008"]},{"id":"uni00152_3","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1784,3568],"sp":[300,300],"atk":[310,622],"def":[229,456],"spd":[72,72],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["4","80007","80008"]}],"skills":{"4":{"slot":"attack","id":4,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 100% Natural damage"}]},"80007":{"slot":"skill1","id":80007,"name":{"ja":"火炎旋風"},"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に中威力で攻撃する"}},{"level":2,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に中威力で攻撃する"}},{"level":3,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に中威力で攻撃する"}},{"level":4,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に中威力で攻撃する"}},{"level":5,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に中威力で攻撃する"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 340% Natural damage"}]},"80008":{"slot":"skill2","id":80008,"name":{"ja":"忍法・火遁槍炎陣―迎春―"},"hits":4,"cutin":true,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":230,"detail":{"ja":"ランダムな敵に小威力で４回攻撃する"}},{"level":2,"sp":230,"detail":{"ja":"ランダムな敵に小威力で４回攻撃する"}},{"level":3,"sp":230,"detail":{"ja":"ランダムな敵に小威力で４回攻撃する"}},{"level":4,"sp":230,"detail":{"ja":"ランダムな敵に小威力で４回攻撃する"}},{"level":5,"sp":230,"detail":{"ja":"ランダムな敵に小威力で４回攻撃する"}}],"effects":[{"text":"Random enemies: 1 hits of 121% Natural damage"}]}},"leader":{"name":{"ja":"稽古初め"},"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ユニットのATKを大アップ"},"effects":[{"text":"Natural allies: ATK +20%","icon":"atk_up"}]},"abilities":[],"bloom":{"points":1,"gold":1,"status":1,"bonus":1,"items":[[1,"blo00002",80],[1,"blo00005",1],[2,"blo00007",15],[3,"blo00010",15],[4,"blo00013",15],[5,"blo00007",15],[6,"blo00010",15],[7,"blo00013",15],[8,"blo00007",15],[9,"blo00010",10],[9,"blo00011",10],[10,"blo00007",10],[10,"blo00008",10],[11,"blo00013",10],[11,"blo00014",10],[12,"blo00002",160],[12,"blo00005",2],[13,"blo00007",10],[13,"blo00008",10],[14,"blo00010",10],[14,"blo00011",10],[15,"blo00013",10],[15,"blo00014",10],[16,"blo00007",10],[16,"blo00008",10],[17,"blo00010",10],[17,"blo00011",10],[18,"blo00013",10],[18,"blo00014",10],[19,"blo00007",10],[19,"blo00008",10],[20,"blo00010",5],[20,"blo00011",15],[20,"blo00012",5],[21,"blo00007",5],[21,"blo00008",15],[21,"blo00009",5],[22,"blo00013",5],[22,"blo00014",15],[22,"blo00015",5],[23,"blo00010",5],[23,"blo00011",15],[23,"blo00012",5],[24,"blo00007",5],[24,"blo00008",15],[24,"blo00009",5],[25,"blo00013",5],[25,"blo00014",15],[25,"blo00015",5],[26,"blo00002",80],[26,"blo00005",1],[27,"blo00008",3],[27,"blo00011",3],[27,"blo00014",3],[28,"blo00008",3],[28,"blo00011",3],[28,"blo00014",3],[29,"blo00008",3],[29,"blo00011",3],[29,"blo00014",3],[30,"blo00008",3],[30,"blo00011",3],[30,"blo00014",3],[31,"blo00002",160],[31,"blo00005",2],[32,"blo00008",3],[32,"blo00011",3],[32,"blo00014",3],[33,"blo00008",3],[33,"blo00011",3],[33,"blo00014",3],[34,"blo00008",3],[34,"blo00011",3],[34,"blo00014",3],[35,"blo00008",3],[35,"blo00011",3],[35,"blo00014",3],[36,"blo00002",160],[36,"blo00005",2],[37,"blo00008",3],[37,"blo00011",3],[37,"blo00014",3],[38,"blo00008",3],[38,"blo00011",3],[38,"blo00014",3],[39,"blo00008",3],[39,"blo00011",3],[39,"blo00014",3],[40,"blo00008",3],[40,"blo00011",3],[40,"blo00014",3],[41,"blo00002",160],[41,"blo00005",2],[42,"blo00008",3],[42,"blo00011",3],[42,"blo00014",3],[43,"blo00008",3],[43,"blo00011",3],[43,"blo00014",3],[44,"blo00008",3],[44,"blo00011",3],[44,"blo00014",3],[45,"blo00008",3],[45,"blo00011",3],[45,"blo00014",3],[46,"blo00002",160],[46,"blo00005",2],[47,"blo00008",3],[47,"blo00009",1],[47,"blo00011",3],[47,"blo00012",1],[47,"blo00014",3],[47,"blo00015",1],[48,"blo00008",3],[48,"blo00009",1],[48,"blo00011",3],[48,"blo00012",1],[48,"blo00014",3],[48,"blo00015",1],[49,"blo00008",3],[49,"blo00009",1],[49,"blo00011",3],[49,"blo00012",1],[49,"blo00014",3],[49,"blo00015",1],[50,"blo00008",3],[50,"blo00009",1],[50,"blo00011",3],[50,"blo00012",1],[50,"blo00014",3],[50,"blo00015",1]]},"voices":[{"type":"new","label":"Acquired","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"あけおめー。私が眞田焔だ！　……ンだよ、そのツラは？　私がこんな格好しちゃおかしいのかよ！？","en":"Happy New Year! I'm Sanada Homura! …What's with that face? Is it weird for me to dress like this!?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00152_1/uni00152_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"なんだヒマなのかよ？　だったら私と特訓しようぜ、特訓！","en":"What, you're bored? Then let's train together, training!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00152_1/uni00152_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"んぁっ！？　……コラ、突くなっての！？　テメぇ、うっぜーンだよ！","en":"Huh!? …Hey, don't poke me! You're so annoying!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00152_1/uni00152_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"オイ。いま私の槍に触っただろ？　……お、オイ！？　そこはもっと触っちゃだめだろーが！？","en":"Hey. You just touched my spear, right? …Hey!? You shouldn't be touching it like that!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00152_1/uni00152_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"はぁー、ケンカしてぇ。でもせっかくの晴れ着が汚れちゃ意味ねーし。……あーぁ、ケンカしてー","en":"Man, I want to fight. But it'd be a waste to dirty this fancy outfit. …Ah, I want to fight."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00152_1/uni00152_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"どうもこの晴れ着ってのは動きづれぇよなあ。……おっと、こんな時はこのタスキの出番だぜ。どうよ！","en":"This fancy outfit really restricts movement… Oh, looks like it's time for this sash to shine. What do you think!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00152_1/uni00152_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"新年だからって、サボってんじゃねーぞ？　いまから私と一緒に特訓だ。さっさと外に出な！","en":"Just because it's New Year's doesn't mean you can slack off. From now on we're training together. Get out there!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00152_1/uni00152_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"なにぃ。“馬子にも衣装”だと？　てめぇイイ根性してるじゃねぇか。表へ出やがれ！","en":"What? \"Even a packhorse looks good in costume\"? You've got some guts. Get out there!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00152_1/uni00152_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00152_1/uni00152_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00152_1/uni00152_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00152_1/uni00152_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00152_1/uni00152_1_dmg_1.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00152_1/uni00152_1_dmg_2.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00152_1/uni00152_1_dmg_3.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00152_1/uni00152_1_evo_1.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00152_1/uni00152_1_evo_2.ogg"},{"type":"lup","label":"Level Up","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00152_1/uni00152_1_lup_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00152_1/uni00152_1_msr_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00152_1/uni00152_1_msr_2.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00152_1/uni00152_1_rdy_1.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00152_1/uni00152_1_rdy_2.ogg"},{"type":"res","label":"Result","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00152_1/uni00152_1_res_1.ogg"},{"type":"wav","label":"Wave","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00152_1/uni00152_1_wav_1.ogg"}],"trust":[100],"scenes":[["chr_0086_r18"]],"stills":[["chr_0086a_r18"]],"obtain":[{"kind":"gacha","type":"Limited","title":{"ja":"【復刻】期間限定正月ガチャ"},"start":"2025-12-31","end":"2026-01-16"},{"kind":"spark","title":null,"need":100,"start":null,"end":null}],"standardPool":false,"art":{"graphicId":"uni_00152","graphicNum":3,"r18GraphicId":"uni_00152_r18","r18GraphicNum":2,"spineId":"Chr_0088"}}